      "solution": "Hướng dẫn giải\n(a) CH3Cl + KOH → CH3OH + KCl\n(b) CH3CH2Br + NaOH → CH3CH2OH + NaBr\n(c) CH2=CHCH2Cl + NaOH → CH2=CHCH2OH + NaCl\n(d) C6H5CH2Cl + NaOH\nC6H5CH2OH + NaCl\n(e) CH3CH2Br\nCH2=CH2 + HBr\n(g)"
